# GRN frozen cost (read-only)

## Terminology (never mix)

| Concept | Source | API / UI fields |
|---------|--------|-----------------|
| **Vendor Spend** | PO (`purchase_order_items`) | `vendor_unit_rate`, `vendor_spend_total` |
| **Inventory Cost (WAC)** | GRN frozen (`grn_items`) | `cost_snapshot`, `posted_unit_cost` |

`ProcurementCostTerminology` (backend) / `procurementCostTerminology.ts` (frontend) are the canonical labels.

## Allowed sources for inventory cost (approved GRNs)

Read **only** from:

- `grn_items.merchandise_unit_cost`, `cess_unit_cost`, `freight_unit_cost`, `landed_unit_cost`
- `grn_items.line_subtotal_accepted`, `line_cess_accepted`, `line_freight_allocated`
- `grns.inventory_costing_mode`
- `GrnItemCostSnapshot::fromGrnItem()` (single reader class)

## Forbidden for cost reads

- `purchase_order_items` (unit_price, subtotal, total_cess, etc.)
- `inventory_items.cost_price`
- `LandedCostAllocator` at read time (approve write only in `GrnService::approve()`)

Policy constants: `GrnFrozenCostPolicy`  
API attachment: `GrnApiPresenter::withCostSnapshots()`

Never recompute landed cost in controllers, reports, or serializers.
